            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Meso 0.2.5 Beta

This is a beta of the new Meso, rebuilt from the ground up, on its way to 0.3.0. It has had far less testing than 0.2.4: install it only if you're happy to report what breaks. For now it runs on Macs with Apple silicon only.

**Coming from 0.2.4**
- The first time it opens, Meso brings over your settings, devices, buttons, keys, gestures and sequences, Time, usage statistics, Kindle export records and AI keys.
- Everything 0.2.4 wrote is kept untouched in `~/Library/Application Support/Meso/Backups/Meso 0.2`. To go back, install 0.2.4 again and move those files back.
- Not brought over: recipes, the menu bar layout, the downloader's list of past jobs, and a few actions the new Meso doesn't have yet.

**Updates**
- This build follows the Beta channel and updates itself to later betas.

**New in this build**
- Shelf: dropping a picture dragged from a web page no longer makes Meso quit. The last beta still did.
- Plugins are ready as soon as Meso opens. Each one used to fail its first start and come back a moment later.
- Open App, used on the app that's already in front, hides it without reporting that it didn't open.
- Meso's log is much shorter: a computer that's away and unchanged trackpad gestures are no longer written every time.
]]></description>
